      "text": {
        "hi": "सवाल पूछना आसान है! ‘is’ या ‘are’ को आगे ले आओ: It is a cat → Is it a cat?",
        "hinglish": "Sawaal poochna aasaan hai! ‘is’ ya ‘are’ ko aage le aao: It is a cat → Is it a cat?",
        "en": "Asking a question is easy! Move ‘is’ or ‘are’ to the front: It is a cat → Is it a cat?"
      }
    },
