        "hinglish": "Hindi mein ‘kya’ lagaate hain, English mein ‘is/are’ aage aata hai. Jawab chhota do: Yes, it is. / No, it is not.",
        "en": "Hindi adds ‘kya’; English moves ‘is/are’ to the front. Give a short answer: Yes, it is. / No, it is not."
      }
